From 4519d5442be74e08bddcf6a2090f6a60c5b8c569 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Voqii <codylepine4@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 03:47:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] 2.3.14/2.3.15-voqii: built-in combat logging,
 kp.inventory.keep for staff

2.3.14: a hit tags both players for Combat.Logout.Seconds; while tagged, BlockedCommands are refused and logging out in an arena counts as a death credited to the last attacker. kp.combatlog.bypass skips it (default false).

2.3.15: kp.inventory.keep (default op, child of kp.arena.bypass) stops KitPvP clearing your inventory on join, world entry, leave, respawn, kit pick and /kp spawn.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
